source: crates/rune-cli/tests/inspection.rs
description: a serial group whose first member is a parallel group
expression: reported(&output)
---
ci

runs         check → build → test
directory    .

members
  check        runs lint, typecheck, format at once
               on failure   lets the others finish, then reports
    lint       biome lint .
    typecheck  tsc --noEmit
    format     biome format .
  build        tsc -b
               runs first   clean:all
               lifecycle    ends the whole tree after 600000 ms
  test         vitest run
               environment  NODE_ENV=test  this script's `env`
                            TZ=UTC         this script's `env`

resolved through
  rune.config.ts  ci  runs check, build, test
